  # VULN-06 Remediation Verification
  
  ## Objective:
  Verify that `updateStory` extracts only permitted, user-editable fields and strictly ignores/protects `createdBy`, preventing mass assignment tampering.
  
  ## Expected Result:
  Response returns 200 OK, title is updated to "Secured Story Update", but `createdBy` retains its original legitimate owner ID (does not become "000000000000000000000000").
  
  Capture a screenshot for your AFTER evidence!
}
